[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://cnpc0captain01"]

; THE CAPTAIN - the killer. He is NOT part of the interrogation/escort (the
; investigator handles that alone). He sits in his OFFICE until ~2:00, brushing
; the detective off ("I'm busy"), then walks to the LOCKER ROOM and vanishes
; into the hidden passage (vanish_into_passage_at) to do the killing cell-side.
; The passage is sealed to the player, so on a blind run he just disappears and
; the witness dies in a sealed cell - the impossible death.
;
; Proving guilt (locker 0806) doesn't change his route - it only unlocks the
; CATCH: endgame_director lets you intercept him in the locker room during
; 2:45-3:00, before he vanishes. Paced walk; his office idle-hold is authored.

[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://scenes/player/character_rig.tscn" id="1_rig"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/game/captain.gd" id="2_captain"]

